#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/CMYK_adjust.rst:41
msgid ""
"This effect applies CMYK\\ [1]_ adjustments to specific color ranges\\ [2]_. "
"The adjustment range is defined by the \"purity\" of the color (i.e. how "
"saturated it already is)."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt aplikuje úpravy CMYK\\ [1]_ na špecifické farebné rozsahy\\ "
"[2]_. Rozsah úpravy je definovaný „čistotou\" farby (t. j. mierou jej "
"nasýtenia)."

